[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_02_0010","text":"哎呀～……！\n推得好用力～……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_02_0020","text":"是啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_02_0030","text":"超——饿的～！\n晚饭我打算结束后再吃的嘛～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_02_0040","text":"喂冬优子酱，要不要吃点再回去！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_02_0050","text":"你……这个点了还……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_02_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_02_0060","text":"哇，写着“汉堡排”！\n──啊，还有卖大阪烧的店哦！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_02_0070","text":"所以说，现在怎么能吃那种油腻的东西──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_02_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_02_0080","text":"～～……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_02_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_02_0090","text":"……汉堡排！\n既然要吃就吃个痛快"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_02_0100","text":"太好了～！\n那就去这家吧～！"}]
